        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Entwistle\n- Bands: The Who\n- Songs: Overture, Tommy\n- Albums: Tommy\n- Charts: UK charts, Billboard Hot 100\n\nFacts:\n- John Entwistle was the original bass guitarist for The Who.\n- The Who recorded the song \"Overture.\"\n- The song \"Tommy\" appears alongside \"Overture\" on The Who's fourth studio album, \"Tommy.\"\n- The song \"Tommy\" reached No. 4 on the UK charts and No. 19 on the U.S. Billboard Hot 100.",
